{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>警方表示，荃灣警區特別職務隊聯同入境處，根據線報及經深入調查後，昨日（4日）展開代號「嶺馬」(LANDMASTER)的掃黃行動。</p><p>行動中，執法人員於川龍街、海壩街、大屋街及荃灣街市街一帶，共拘捕7名內地女子，年齡介乎30歲至44歲，涉嫌「違反逗留條件」。所有被捕人現正被扣留調查，稍後將交由入境處跟進。</p><p>據了解，所有被捕內地女子持雙程證入境。</p><figure><img alt=\"執法人員拘捕多名涉案女子。（警方提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261105/1194804867126923264793260.jpeg/4eW8NGM2qvlHyDtx6JixF3k7VFc2cC2u8K5o-PCuaPg\"/><figcaption>執法人員拘捕多名涉案女子。（警方提供）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"執法人員拘捕涉案女子。（警方提供）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261105/1194804864442437632214896.jpeg/hK53NF7jO8I6GHkk0Ev2UodvNdAbLDAaiOyNkYjsjZE\"/><figcaption>執法人員拘捕涉案女子。（警方提供）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T17:05:35.100581+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":209,"images":2,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T16:50:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T17:58:50.654793+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T16:58:40.476852+00:00","content_hash":"28aee61f386a0b2ced465825b45d2afecf22e863ecddae80b341966b693e4aff","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}